<title>USA: Bruno's sees about $4 mln in savings.</title>
<headline>Bruno's sees about $4 mln in savings.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bruno's Inc said Friday that it had entered into an amendment to its bank credit agreement that will result in about $4 million in annual interest savings.</p>
<p>On Friday the company reported a first quarter net loss of $5.1 million, or $.20 per share, on sales of $685.3 million.</p>
